{"articles":[{"no":"第一點","path":[],"text":"為增進市容觀瞻，有效管理雜項工作物，減少違建情況\n\n\n    ，特訂定本原則。","id":"嘉義市-GL000385/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"d31fd7e9819399e5967374a083780614b6d323a5bb57b357785cd1154aedd84b","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第二點","path":[],"text":"本原則適用範圍除都市計畫書圖或其他法令規定外，為\n\n\n    都市計畫住宅區（含前、後院地區）。","id":"嘉義市-GL000385/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"3019c4818e746a96ad9413d191b1fe5b737f59eb46151986d32e5cc949a307df","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第三點","path":[],"text":"本原則所稱大門式圍牆為連接圍牆之大門具有頂蓋投影\n\n\n    面積之雜項工作物","id":"嘉義市-GL000385/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"7da4c53e45c09778e2bf72a7109e122bb1b446834cbc23e2a5b64920ad48fbf2","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第四點","path":[],"text":"大門式圍牆應臨接建築線或私設通路邊界地籍線，並視\n\n\n    同建築技術規則雨遮規定辦理。\n\n    本原則未規定者，依相關法令規定辦理。","id":"嘉義市-GL000385/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"8e224ad1508e997c846ebd2eace90f58073a7ef18ca6484811679e6ba67a16c7","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第五點","path":[],"text":"大門式圍牆免自建築線或私設通路邊界地籍線退縮二十\n\n\n    公分建築。","id":"嘉義市-GL000385/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"4a03523b77cff62482344b90792ea3e7b3c53ff4ee9299371b5e40bff6f547c9","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第六點","path":[],"text":"大門式圍牆自建築線或私設通路邊界地籍線之垂直投影\n\n\n    深度未超過一公尺者，不計入建築面積。","id":"嘉義市-GL000385/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"1a0e8f3ad076e2c3f7399cbeb90a222014e4708482d3f72d0907232a90a886db","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第七點","path":[],"text":"大門式圍牆其深度超過上述規定時，超出部分應計入建\n\n\n    築面積。但都市計畫前、後院地區除外。","id":"嘉義市-GL000385/a:7","anchor":"a-7","contentHash":"5d793fa04b2b9bfe40ce1447bae6a295b96ee5a9c915375134453dad2b19237e","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第八點","path":[],"text":"大門式圍牆之高度不得超過四點二公尺。","id":"嘉義市-GL000385/a:8","anchor":"a-8","contentHash":"ced6ebe2fb66914aeb5b3ae59a2e77b0476af153646ffa065cbb83efa9b0dfe1","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}}],"attachments":[],"category":"建築與設計","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"","id":"嘉義市-GL000385","keywords":[],"kind":"地方規定","modified":"民國 104 年 11 月 20 日","name":"嘉義市免計建築面積雜項工作物大門式圍牆設置原則","region":"嘉義市","source":"嘉義市法規查詢系統","status":"來源現行頁","url":"https://law.chiayi.gov.tw/LawContent.aspx?id=GL000385","retrieved":"2026-09-29T00:34:17+00:00","snapshot":"","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"ad846b7538ee81b5a3d0b5328ce8507a51dc0d05d4020b1758ed56b5225c6b1c","sourceRecordId":"嘉義市-GL000385","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-29T00:39:28+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"民國 104 年 11 月 20 日","effectiveDate":""}}